                                "sense_id": "d8ac610d-b4cc-3aae-9d04-33aa44cdb03f",
                                "text": "Here standard acoustic instruments are played in ways that suggest electronic sound: violins whir and buzz, woodwinds produce a toneless breathiness and a gentle tapping evokes a heartbeat."
